# CloudFront E1IKCN86TX9AGT:
# Origin MicrobitProjectStore: legacy.circuitsketcher.com, HTTPS-only/TLSv1.2.
# Custom origin header: X-Microbit-Origin-Token (secret; not in this repository).
# Behavior /api/share/* -> MicrobitProjectStore; viewer HTTPS-only.
# Allowed methods: all seven (CloudFront's POST-capable option); API handles GET/POST only.
# Cache policy: Managed-CachingDisabled (4135ea2d-6df8-44a3-9df3-4b5a84be39ad).
# Origin request policy: Managed-AllViewerExceptHostHeader (b689b0a8-53d0-40ab-baf2-68738e2966ac).
# Keep the existing default S3 origin/behavior unchanged.
